WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.900
Deep in the woods, leaves whisper wrong answers and roots rearrange the trail.

2
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:17.200
Each new kind of fiend has a different trick, and familiar-looking problems hide unfamiliar dangers.

3
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:25.100
Your fireballs light the way. Your growing earth magic holds the shifting ground steady.

4
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.100
Beyond the bridge, thunder rolls from a cloudless sky.

5
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.000
Act III: The Whispering Woods · Levels 21–30
